abstract: >-
  Surrogate-model-driven multi-objective optimization of building retrofit
  design considering energy use intensity (EUI), indoor discomfort degree (IDD)
  and operational carbon intensity (OCI) under baseline and mid-future (2050)
  climate and grid-decarbonization scenarios.
